00:03:21.017 --> 00:03:22.932
Would you fuck yourself for money?

00:03:22.932 --> 00:03:26.160
A-ha-ha-ha-ha, you suck at parking.

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:30.281
So, I've got my first
break from getting heckled,

00:03:30.281 --> 00:03:32.235
and so far he hasn't gotten under my skin.

00:03:32.235 --> 00:03:33.317
Nice guy, I like him.

00:03:33.317 --> 00:03:35.073
- [J. Chris] Any final
words before they tell you

00:03:35.073 --> 00:03:36.570
