00:03:42.748 --> 00:03:43.856
What'd you have for lunch?

00:03:43.856 --> 00:03:46.259
I had like a chicken pita thing.

00:03:46.259 --> 00:03:48.059
It's so hard to be mean to you.

00:03:48.059 --> 00:03:49.800
It's just so hard, because everything

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:51.205
