00:04:06.349 --> 00:04:08.114
What's it like bein'
around Jordan all day?

00:04:08.114 --> 00:04:09.194
He's a great guy.

00:04:09.194 --> 00:04:10.645
Really nice, really quiet.

00:04:10.645 --> 00:04:13.074
Kinda sits to himself.
No, I said Jordan.

00:04:13.074 --> 00:04:15.605
Gettin' ready to go down to
the Laugh Factory from The Den.

00:04:15.605 --> 00:04:17.033
Gonna get on stage and do some jokes,

00:04:17.033 --> 00:04:19.959
