like I've heckled him all day.

00:04:19.959 --> 00:04:20.911
Hey, what's up.

00:04:20.911 --> 00:04:21.744
How's is goin'?

00:04:21.744 --> 00:04:22.577
I'm in pretty good shape.

00:04:22.577 --> 00:04:23.653
I'm in really good spirits.

00:04:23.653 --> 00:04:25.252
I've lost a lot of weight,
ever since I quit--

00:04:25.252 --> 00:04:26.669
Is that the shirt you picked?

00:04:26.669 --> 00:04:28.515
(playful music)

00:04:28.515 --> 00:04:30.465
Did you just pick up the
first t-shirt off the floor

00:04:30.465 --> 00:04:32.543
