00:04:32.543 --> 00:04:34.935
and decide, that's the shirt for my set?

00:04:34.935 --> 00:04:37.315
(playful music)
Uh, yes, actually.

00:04:37.315 --> 00:04:38.148
That's what I did.

00:04:38.148 --> 00:04:39.184
I decided that.

00:04:39.184 --> 00:04:40.264
I asked this girl out once,

00:04:40.264 --> 00:04:42.493
