no idea what sex sounds like.

00:05:00.537 --> 00:05:03.080
Aren't you sitting in a booth alone?

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:04.377
Yeah.

00:05:04.377 --> 00:05:05.852
I just childproofed my house,

00:05:05.852 --> 00:05:08.430
